OL,3,GNEWSAHousing scheme to go ahead despite
OL,4,Acouncil refusal
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build 156 homes in a village
OL,7,Fhave been approved, months after
OL,8,Fcouncillors unanimously rejected them.
OL,10,FPartner Construction is set to build
OL,11,Fthe homes on land close to Westerton
OL,12,FRoad, in Coundon, near Bishop Auckland
OL,13,Fin County Durham.
OL,15,FThe county council refused the plans in
OL,16,FMarch after hundreds of objections were
OL,17,Fmade and concerns were raised about the
OL,18,Fimpact on the countryside.
OL,20,FBut the developer appealed against the
OL,21,Fdecision and the Planning Inspectorate
OL,22,Fhas now approved the project.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
